<title>USA: Nobel Education Dynamics Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Nobel Education Dynamics Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MEDIA, Pa. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 vs. 1995</p>
<p>					   Proforma		Proforma</p>
<p>			    1995	   1995	   1996  Pct chg</p>
<p> Revenues	  $13,389,239   $13,389,239  $15,701,370   17%</p>
<p> Net income	    605,478   518,484 (A)	652,651   26%</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>  earnings per share    0.09	    0.08	   0.09   13%</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	6,644,889     6,664,889    7,543,520   13%</p>
<p>	 Year</p>
<p> Revenues	 $44,154,367	$44,154,367 $58,909,398  33%</p>
<p> Net income     3,843,886(B)     1,498,148(B)  2,462,892  64%</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>  earnings per share    0.63	    0.24(A)	 0.34  42%</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 6,129,121	  6,129,121  7,336,591  20%</p>
<p>(A) The 1995 Proforma reflects net income as if the Company was taxed at the same effective rate as 1996.</p>
<p>(B) 1995 year results are after a $62,000 gain from tax loss carryforward.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
